# Internal working material — local only, deliberately NOT published.
#
# These are the AI/human maintenance notes for this project: the rulebook, the
# incident history, the audits, the backlog and the product decisions. Roughly
# 500KB of "how this repo is worked on" rather than "what this repo is".
#
# They stay on disk for every local session and every future one; what changes is
# that a clone of the public repo no longer carries them. Users verifying the
# extension (PRIVACY.md, PLATFORMS.md, the source) are unaffected — those are the
# documents that answer "does this thing steal my cookies", and they remain public.
#
# Kept OUT of this list on purpose, because tests read them:
#   docs/ARCHITECTURE.md   (tests/architecture.typeContract.test.ts)
#   docs/PUBLISHING.md     (tests/hosts.singleSource.test.ts)
AGENTS.md
docs/AGENTS_CASES.md
docs/AUDIT_2026-09-12.md
docs/REVIEW_2026-09.md
docs/PHASE_REPORT_2026-09.md
docs/PROJECT_PROGRESS_2026-09.md
docs/PRODUCT_DECISIONS.md
docs/archive/
